5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since we need to decide how to allocate the spaces fairly, I think it's important to understand the history and the atmosphere. I'll look into the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to work with you all. I am worried about how the bikes are handled in the mornings, so I will look into the morning departures and the rain exposure along the rows.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'll take a look at the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station. I'm curious about the money side of things and what the alternatives are nearby.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we should consider the practical side of managing any new system. I will look into the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I want to know if the current setup is actually fair or just feels that way! I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, and also the account from the neighbouring block's secretary.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Does anyone else feel that the current arrangement might be causing a bit of friction? I hope the information we find helps us find a way for everyone to get along peacefully.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue I completely agree! It's all well and good to have a rule, but if it makes everyone grumpy, it's not really a win, is it? I'm hoping the numbers will give us a clear path.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree that harmony is important, but we must also ensure that whatever we decide is sustainable. A rule that is too complex to maintain will only lead to more friction in the long run.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! That's why I'm checking the neighbors. If they tried something and it failed, we can avoid the same mistake. I just want to make sure we aren't ignoring the people who actually use their bikes every day!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree with George. A sustainable system is the only way to avoid future conflict. I hope the minutes and logs will reveal if we've repeated the same mistakes in the past.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very wise point, Misaki. It would be a shame to repeat old mistakes. I only wish for a solution where no one feels burdened or pushed aside in the morning rush.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm sure we can find a balance! If we can figure out the costs and the options outside, maybe we can make a deal that feels like a win for everyone. Let's see what we find!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,Indeed. Let us focus on the facts once we have the information. I look forward to seeing if the physical requirements of the equipment match our capacity to maintain them.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm getting excited to see the results! I hope we find a way to make it fair for everyone, whether they use their bikes every day or just once in a while. Let's do this!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we have a good spread of information covered. Let's proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring the facts back to the table and make a fair decision.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all look into our chosen topics with care. I look forward to hearing what you all discover so we can find a gentle solution together.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm all set! Let's dive in and see what the records actually say. I have a feeling some of these ""mysteries"" are going to be quite interesting once we uncover them. See you all in the next round!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I concur. Let us proceed with the research. I shall examine the files and the equipment trial with a critical eye to ensure we do not commit ourselves to an impossible task.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Me too! I'll be super thorough. I can't wait to see if my suspicions about the ""same old places"" are right. Let's find the best way to fix this!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
